{
  "en": "Independent analysis: Time should enter the model as a distribution, not a single completion date. Suppose a hypothetical project will receive $100 million in year five. At a 10% annual discount rate, that receipt is worth about $62.1 million today; a two-year delay reduces it to about $51.3 million. This isolated timing effect excludes construction inflation, interim revenue, taxes and financing details. It illustrates sensitivity, not an estimate of any project in the article.",
  "zh": "独立分析：应把工期视为一个概率分布，而不是单一日期。假设某项目第五年取得一亿美元收入，以每年10%折现，现值约为6210万美元；推迟两年后约为5130万美元。这一假设计算仅隔离时间影响，未计入建设通胀、中间收入、税费及融资细节，也不估算原文中的任何项目。"
}

{
  "en": "Independent analysis: A useful approval-workflow product would record who owns each decision, what evidence is missing, and when dependencies become actionable. The buyer should measure fewer repeated submissions, less rework and shorter handoff delays. Generating documents faster is valuable only if it removes the actual constraint. Software cannot grant an agency authority it does not possess.",
  "zh": "独立分析：审批协作产品可以记录每项决定的责任人、缺失证据及前置条件何时满足。购买者应衡量重复提交、返工和交接等待是否减少。只有实际瓶颈被消除，文档生成加速才会转化为项目价值；软件本身无法赋予机构并不存在的权限。"
}

{
  "en": "Independent analysis: Procurement should distinguish an earlier decision from an earlier successful operation. A pilot could track days from a complete application to a decision, days from approval to commissioning, and the share of files reopened. Each metric needs a fixed starting definition and comparable project categories. Otherwise a team can appear faster merely by moving difficult work outside the reported interval.",
  "zh": "独立分析：采购评估应区分更早作出决定与更早投入有效运营。试点可以跟踪完整申请至决定的天数、获批至投运的天数以及重新审查的比例。每个指标都需要固定起点和可比项目分类，否则团队可能只是把困难工作挪到统计区间之外，看上去更快。"
}

analysis.limitations:
{
  "en": "Independent critique: Comparing unusually successful historical projects with unusually delayed contemporary ones risks selection bias. A stronger study would include completed, rejected and abandoned projects, control for scope and geography, and report medians and tail outcomes. The essay alone cannot isolate the contribution of regulation from procurement, design changes, labor availability or financing.",
  "zh": "独立评估：把历史上的杰出项目与当代严重延期项目相比，可能存在选择偏差。更有说服力的研究应同时纳入完工、被拒和中止项目，控制规模及地理差异，并报告中位数与长尾结果。仅凭该评论无法将监管影响与采购、设计变更、劳动力供给和融资因素分离。"
}

{
  "en": "Independent critique: A speed target can create incentives to reject difficult applications, defer impact assessments, or undercount affected communities. Evaluation therefore needs outcome safeguards: compliance findings, preventable damage, community participation and the cost of later corrections. Faster processing is not a sufficient definition of public value.",
  "zh": "独立评估：速度目标可能诱使执行者拒绝复杂申请、推迟影响评估，或少计受影响社区。评估因此需要同时观察合规发现、可避免损害、公众参与及后续纠错成本。办得更快不足以单独定义公共价值。"
}

